  "question": {
    "text": "The initial speed of a projectile fired from ground is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math>. At the highest point during its motion, the speed of projectile is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>u</mi></math>. The time of flight of the projectile is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>u</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0039_8c76fbd34fa2.png\" style=\"width: 310px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p>At maximum height, only horizontal velocity of the particle remains. Let the angle of project be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>. The horizontal velocity of the particle will remain same, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Now, time of flight of projectile is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
